+		 * notifications now come every sweetfb_vsync_div panel refreshes (default 0 = the old 60 Hz timer; 1 = 90 Hz,
+		 * 2 = 45 Hz, each frame on screen for exactly two refreshes), on absolute deadlines (no drift from the work
+		 * done in the handler), kept in phase with the frames done the presenter sees. sweetfb_vsync_us=N: any period.
+		 */
+		uint32_t div = 0, us = 0;
+		uint64_t period = SWEET_FB_VSYNC_US;
